@*
    Task 14.4 — the ASP.NET Core replacement for this plugin's web.config
    <system.web.webPages.razor><pages> element (Requirement 4.4).

    Identical in shape to tasks 10.1/11.2/14.1's; only the plugin's own Models namespace differs.
    See src/Plugins/Nop.Plugin.DiscountRules.CustomerRoles/Views/_ViewImports.cshtml for the full
    reasoning. @inherits → the WebViewPage base (makes T("…") and an unqualified @model resolve);
    the @using directives → the web.config's four System.Web <namespaces> (System.Web.Mvc.Ajax has
    no ASP.NET Core counterpart and is dropped).

    NOTE this plugin has SIX views, five of them under Views/ and all reached by walking up from
    their linked path to this single Views/_ViewImports.cshtml. _FixedRate.cshtml has NO @model,
    so it compiles as WebViewPage<dynamic> — that is fine. The Kendo grid views also use
    RouteValueDictionary and FormMethod, both covered by the Microsoft.AspNetCore.* usings below.
*@
@inherits Nop.Web.Framework.ViewEngines.Razor.WebViewPage<TModel>

@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Html
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Rendering
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing

@using Nop.Core.Infrastructure
@using Nop.Web.Framework
@using Nop.Web.Framework.UI
@using Nop.Plugin.Shipping.FixedOrByWeight.Models

@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
